# Havok animations are binary. Git's own NUL-byte detection has always classified
# them correctly, but core.autocrlf is true on this machine and the packaging build
# depends on Nemesis .txt files still getting CRLF on checkout -- so the safe fix is
# to pin the binaries explicitly rather than to touch the global text setting.
# A mangled .hkx does not fail the build; it fails in game, silently.
*.hkx binary
